  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention of agrochemical pollution in the Upper Litani River Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Reduce agro-chemical pollution of surface and ground water in BaalBack in order to contribute to reducing the overall pollution of the Litani River and of Lake Qaraoun and enhance the quality of water for all downstream users.  In addition, the decrease of the use of agrichemicals will be reflected in more profitability of farmers and reduced effects on the health of farmers and consumers due to reduced risk of poisoning and diseases incidents related to the excess use of agrochemicals.</narrative>
  </description>
